{\fs28\b\cf1 Sales notes}\par
{\b 1.} "Research" claims: keep it as your experience + expert consensus ("feeding experts", "sach ye hai"), not unspecified "studies say" - vague science claims can get Meta ads flagged and feel less credible.\par
{\b 2.} On-screen text on the hook + CTA does half the selling (most watch on mute) - bake those captions in.\par
{\b 3.} One CTA per reel only - and pin the first comment with the link/keyword so people act.\par
{\b 4.} Overlay real B-roll (dinner moments, the book/printables, a child trying a green) on your talking-head to lift retention.\par
{\b 5.} For cold ads, lead with Videos 6, 1, 3, 2 (story + pain hooks convert coldest traffic best).\par
